  m_Name: GoodBusinessQuest
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Game::Quests.QuestDefinition
  Id: good_for_business
  DisplayName: Good for Business
  Description: "“You want to survive here? Then learn one thing fast —
    junk keeps people alive.\nAmmo, tools, scrap, broken electronics… somebody
    always pays for something.\n\nMost rookies hoard everything until they die with
    a backpack full of garbage. Smart ones know when to sell.\n\nBring me anything
    valuable you find out there and sell goods worth at least 1,000 Credits. I don’t
    care what it is, as long as it’s worth something and not covered in fresh
    blood.\n\nThink of this as your first lesson in trade: gear comes and goes, but
    steady profit keeps you breathing.”"
  RequiredLevel: 0
  NpcId: AL
